Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you\Nas you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that. Wind to\Ndry all the tears as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're plating the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure,\Nfound in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly quite hot down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.34,0:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden! Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start fighting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, clear out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The warts' poison will get us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was finally gonna make it to all\Nthat awesome-smelling food over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jawboy, whatever you do, don't fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, that's Magellan,\Nthe warden of Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the power of the venom venom fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the last person\Nyou ever want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Venom, Venom version? He's poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bit out of your\Nelements, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a rookie,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected more from a pirate\Nwith a bounty of 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially one who has caused the\Nworld government so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine how you managed to worm\Nyour way through security, but here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, you will suffer\Nfor tarnishing my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why you're here, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to rescue your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. A.,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,2nd Division Commander of the Whitebeard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates You've had quite\Nthe little rampage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but all of that will come to an end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And one final thing, I will find out\Nexactly how you broke into my prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You will spill every\Nlast juicy detail to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish, I wish I could\Ndo more to help you, but!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die before I say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan's whole body is poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, terrible poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so much as touch\Nhim, you're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't bait a guy like that. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To the pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, give up on that stupid food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's hightail it to level 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The staircase to level 5 is protected by\Nthree demon guards and their commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every exit on this floor has\Nalready been accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no more running.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A venom monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still evacuating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The warden guy's poisoning his own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The hydrous venom is a\Nparalytic neuron. Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes its way through your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing horrific pain\Nbefore you finally die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Boss, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of the way when I'm\Nfighting, you damn fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're terribly sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think about\Nfood in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, you've got to respect\Na man that knows what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I admire your bravery, dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It just sucks that\Nwe're both going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch me if you can, Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I forgot it's really hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the heads is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some of your\Nbrother's cunning after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chloroform ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your gas masks on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The warden's in the middle of a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Sear gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's Magellan's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go somewhere else to fight, you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's he up against anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that intruder\Nthey were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So hell heat plus poison gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes, it's like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Down the Venom road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One touch and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's melting through the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,First the wall, and then you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta rescue Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely, even you must know\Nthat your death is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we have to make a move\Nwhile Magellan is busy with Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how many gods there\Nare down there. It's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They assign the more powerful demon guards\Nto protect the staircase to level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more important to them to not let\NStraw Hat get down to the lower levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning they are the crappiest\Nsecurity they have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If we miss this chance, soon\Nafter they'll time their defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat will lose at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he does, this window is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must get to level\Nthree before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard anything about Vice Warden\NHannibal having any Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can take out those guards\Nwith a muggy ball, we can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hannibal can't be that tough\Nright now. You're thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to stay in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,this heat one moment longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is going to stop\Nus from getting through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden Hannibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Buggy the Clown and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're trying\Nto get to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let those bastards go any higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, McGee! Can do! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan guards the\Nmost dangerous criminals
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in the most infamous\Nprison in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the lord and master of hell itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to let Strawboy\Nface him alone, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just no way to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you,\Nbut you wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Running is the only answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.60,0:10:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Strawboy. I'm a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you put an end to\Nthis nonsense and submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to rescue my brother, and\Nwe'll escape from here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die without even seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let you\Nexecute him, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't win without touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take my arms, but I won't lose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I need your arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to take you\Napart piece by piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gong! gong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Morons, what's wrong with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had just slipped\Naway when I told you to,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have blamed\Nthis mess on the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the staircase to level three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a raid by two of the escapees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some casualties here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have Buggy the Clown and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to go through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I said fine, but you wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruin my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hell of a lot\Nstronger than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Hannibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be tortured if\Nthat's what's in store for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bite off my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can beat Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna dream an impossible dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd remain there any longer, I'm\N200 % sure he would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can do is run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem you have\Nbrought me to my knees, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a cornered rabbit will\Nfight with teeth and claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, your hands and arms\Nare covered in my poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're feeling the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Twins it for kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Venom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Glowfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,See you like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum! Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vision getting blurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your ears ringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands have become\Nuseless, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, my poison will\Ntake everything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to do a condemned man a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is something\Nhappening on the upper levels?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you finally done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this your punishment, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to neutralize the amount\Nof poison your body has absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You will suffer an agonizing pain\Nfor 24 hours, and then you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is true hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent battle, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do with Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Any orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die soon, but we don't\Nwant him just lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw him into the central tower\Nof Level 5 until further notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a problem over at\Nthe staircase to Level 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the area Hanyable\Nand his men were guarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's either stone-cold dead\Nor hibernating for the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, my fingers are shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even feel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even bite my stinking bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we stop by the burning hell for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dragging in a newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How much is your bounty worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's nearly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan's already given\Nhim a taste of his poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave for a moment, and\Nthis is what I return to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ennubo, I counted on\Nyou, and you let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Warn it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're choking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was caught off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't torture us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Torture stinks like ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, mine is very\Nsensitive, so please don't whip it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some nutty martial artist\Nballerina did all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be frank with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He took us by surprise, sir. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him slip away and he escaped\Nto the upper levels, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that prisoner used to be\Npart of Crocodile's baroque works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who used to call himself Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rather odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I wouldn't worry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel confident that\Nwe'll catch him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And what of the riot on level two?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Any updates it's winding down\Nalmost under control sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want all the guards on level four\Nto proceed to level three immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want all of mistress 80's\Ndemon guard searching for the escapee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you, right? And\Nwhat about these two, sir? Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure this mess is all cleaned up
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and things are in order\Nby the time I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to head over to\Nmy private place for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My tummy oh the runs. Hey,\Nmove it. Get off your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we still have one last\Nescapee we need to track down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes right away sir um excuse me vice warden\Nwhat do you want to do with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I want to ask them\Na few questions get an
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,interrogation room I'll\Ntake charge of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, right understood,\Nsir. I'll make the preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,okay then they're all yours right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,yes no one's whipping my buttocks\Ntonight okay that's that now what do we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not play dumb. You know what's next.\NWe need to hurry up and rescue Straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,hat before it's too late you're still\Nhung up on that didn't you hear them
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,saying that he's been poisoned by\Nmagellan and taken to level five it's too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,late to save him there's no way he'll\Nsurvive and will be caught tortured
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and die like dogs it's a bad plan why\Nshould we risk our lives to save someone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,who's as good as dead that won't stop\Nme I'll gladly die like a dog for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.28,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,him after turning my back on straw boy\NI'm already dead inside the least I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,do is make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that it was better to run and\Nsave myself than to suffer the same fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I swore that if there was\Nany chance he would survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd return,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,put my life on the line, and rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I must come to his aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a real touching\Nstory, but now you've escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost a free man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to go back out there,\Nguns a-blazin' and risk your life again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm his friend, I don't\Nneed any other reason. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,First we gotta deal with that poison\Nthere's surely they have some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,antidote but then Where would it be you\Nthink there's still time to get an antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,nah I wouldn't bother shut up Already\Nboth of you this is something this is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,something I have to do don't die on me\Nstraw boy Hold on a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No freaking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, what do you mean\Nyou can't make an antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever survives after Warden Magellan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,douses them with that much\Nof his special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was just one kind of poison, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But his is a special multifaceted toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.74,0:24:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There are just too many\Nvariables to account for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.02,0:24:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's impossible, Vice Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And your people call\Nyourselves a medical team?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.20,0:24:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the answer lies\Nahead. Just keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to turn Straw Hat Luffy over to\Nthe Navy, and I want him alive for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.72,0:24:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if we think we're on to a cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.90,0:24:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,if we administer any sort\Nof medication incorrectly,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll most likely die even sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.98,0:24:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be throwing your\Nlife away for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.82,0:24:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let go of that nonsense\Nand think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find a way out of here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.66,0:24:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one survives a battle with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.36,0:24:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It would take a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.12,0:24:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.68,0:24:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:24:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Miracle Worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When doctors give up on a\Npatient, he can still save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.54,0:25:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He can even save a dying country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His list of miracles is legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the greatest. The\Nqueen of all queens, Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.12,0:25:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find out where\Nthey're holding him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, Level Five. Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.72,0:25:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's where we're\Nheaded prisoner transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.70,0:25:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,these two were sentenced\Nto freeze to death
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep walking, scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize this is a bit of a long\Nshot, but I have to do anything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This list of prisoners is presenting more\Nquestions than it's answering, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Empire Ivankov, the real name of\NEva, has been crossed off in red ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he been released already, or\Nhas he been secretly executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.28,0:26:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.68,0:26:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we let this prisoner go free? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.90,0:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Ivankov?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, you know what happened\Nto him a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vice Warden, you forgot?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.02,0:26:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, of course, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.60,0:26:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if you know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are prisoners present, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.68,0:26:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care, out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.42,0:26:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Every so often, people\Ndisappear in Impel Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.26,0:26:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sure they didn't just break out,\Nas some of the missing could barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.16,0:26:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They just vanished without a trace and\Nno one seems to know the cause we've
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.22,0:26:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,come to call it demon in the way all the\Nguards here have come to fear these are
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,natural and strange disappearances we\Nbelieve that those missing have been dragged
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to the gates of hell hence why we call it\Nwhat we do so people just up and vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.16,0:27:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepy. I wish I'd never\Nheard that. Yes, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.54,0:27:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's not even open\Nand it's already freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're even wearing heavy\Nclothes this is it as a fair
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,warning the army wolves are\Nquite hungry today now i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.52,0:27:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,take them from this point on\Njust as usual huh you'll take
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What well, your weapons and\Ncoats, sir? Hmm. Honestly, sir, we
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.70,0:27:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know how you do it you\Nalways tell us i'll show every
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.14,0:27:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,single prisoner the courage\Nof the vice warden and then
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.86,0:27:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,march forward into the freezing\Nhell without a weapon or
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.14,0:27:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,even a coat sincerely we're big\Nadmirers of you for it no way
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,also because they're\Ninappropriate for prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.78,0:27:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to have we'll be taking\Ntheir coats as well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.50,0:27:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our coats, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, transponder snails\Nwon't work, thanks to the cold and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.16,0:28:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.22,0:28:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely use my hand. It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.78,0:28:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unlocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.32,0:28:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell me these aren't\Narmy wolves, are they? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they be on the floor\Nof the wild beasts from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I know why they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because they would eat the other\Nbeasts like the basilisk in the sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for their protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.31,0:28:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.14,0:28:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,These mangy little fleabags\Nare really that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.74,0:28:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna deal with\Nthese damn things, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The cold was bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.50,0:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got another reason\Nfor my teeth to chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Wanna fight? Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.92,0:29:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've got a straw\Nboy, I need to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.38,0:29:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be their dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.84,0:29:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're running already?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.58,0:29:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.94,0:29:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we really have to sit here\Nand just watch this kid die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.86,0:29:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.50,0:29:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only brother I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be nothing more than a\Nleaf whipped about by a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.46,0:30:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,An insect flicked away by hands\Nfar mightier than your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.76,0:30:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you can't survive\Nafter taking that much poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.16,0:30:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you at least hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.62,0:30:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just accept your death graciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.10,0:30:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.94,0:30:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.96,0:30:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die till I rescue Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to save somebody\Nwhen you can't even save yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.22,0:30:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Some friend of yours? How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In prison, it's every\Nman for himself, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's coming to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.92,0:30:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.66,0:31:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all alone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.72,0:31:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sea of fire, you'd trample all\Nover someone else in order to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When you face the beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd kick another prisoner\Nstraight into their hungry jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.16,0:31:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you care\Nabout anyone but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So cut all the\NI-wanna-rescue-someone crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand that talk makes me sick
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look somebody's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.86,0:31:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.12,0:31:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not one of the jailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, is he making?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. I've come here to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.58,0:31:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of our everlasting friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.90,0:32:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.68,0:32:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pal how do you know him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my friend, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.10,0:32:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He left the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.22,0:32:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought about breaking\Nout of here until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find Eva before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.88,0:32:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.24,0:32:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where\Nthat Twinkle Toes went.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.22,0:33:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell wants to know anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.72,0:33:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Empire Ivankov.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.22,0:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that guy. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.14,0:33:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's been missing for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you even want with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you get out of your cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out of mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.86,0:33:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why they're\Nkeeping a man named Eva?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! What's wrong? Hey! Speak up!\NAnswer me! Don't bother! Didn't you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in that cell is frozen stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.40,0:33:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.96,0:33:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Said you're looking for Ivankov, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.99,0:33:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.91,0:33:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.34,0:33:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that forest? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an abandoned jailhouse,\Nway beyond the tree line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.26,0:34:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A while back, I saw this strange\Nguy just dancing around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.98,0:34:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.78,0:34:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.16,0:34:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.56,0:34:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.28,0:34:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That forest, it's where\Nthe wolves live. Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe that those missing have\Nbeen dragged to the gate of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.20,0:34:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence why we call it what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.06,0:34:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The gates of hell, demon-ing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.04,0:34:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit pulling my tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way Eva disappeared because of\Nsome superstitious mumbo-jumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.36,0:34:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met him myself, but his\Nreputation certainly precedes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.82,0:34:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in a hell like this place, I'm\Nsure he can still make a miracle happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.74,0:34:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Eva is our queen, our god!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.16,0:35:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I know he can save Straw Hat Luffy\Nif we can't count on an antidote anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.58,0:35:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's his only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva, I swear I'll find you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.68,0:35:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.42,0:36:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing to my friend Bon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.16,0:36:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, straw boy, how did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The public execution of Five Fist\NAce will take place in 26 hours.
